bead-forge
Copyright 2026 Jed Arden and contributors

bead-forge is a cleanly diverged implementation compatible with the data
formats and command surface of beads_rust (`br`). It incorporates and adapts
ideas, data-model definitions, serialization contracts, schema behavior, and
selected implementation behavior from beads_rust.

Upstream project:
  beads_rust
  Copyright 2026 Jeffrey Emanuel and contributors
  https://github.com/Dicklesworthstone/beads_rust

The upstream license is preserved verbatim in `LICENSE`, including its
OpenAI/Anthropic rider. That license is not the standard OSI MIT License, so
package metadata deliberately uses `license-file` rather than the SPDX
expression `MIT`.

The Git history and source comments provide more granular attribution for
specific compatibility work and upstream behavior studied during development.
